{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CURSED SCARLET MISTRESSES is a Visual Novel based off Team Shanghai Alice's Touhou Project, specifically centered around the Scarlet Mansion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are only a human from the outside world, but because of a strange ritual you are transported into Gensokyo, a land of both unimaginable wonders and inescapable dangers. Somehow, you end up serving in the Scarlet Mansion and being part of its inhabitants life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on your actions from that day onwards and who you <strong>bond</strong> with you can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Know the Scarlet Dynasty's secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Understand the girls' fears and internal conflicts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop a romance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform various tasks at the mansion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the future of Gensokyo</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ROUTES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910310/extras/2b59bbcc81d5498aa13a25fc07f2afdf.avif?t=1768839667\" width=1560 height=927 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2661Remilia Scarlet\u2661</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The unraveling of the Ultimate Curses and Destiny.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2661Patchouli Knowledge\u2661</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The searching of Knowledge and Truth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2661Izayoi Sakuya\u2661</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The meaning of Loyalty and Love.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2661Hong meiling\u2661</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pursuit of Virtue and Strength.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3910310?t=1768839667","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910310/614